 "legend": {
  "#": "ground: solid on all sides (concrete, deck, roof slab)",
  "=": "one-way platform: solid only from above, jump up through it, press ↓ to drop (glass canopy, tree branch)",
  "B": "breakable: solid until hit (precast panel stack), then removed",
  "?": "item block: solid; bonk from below or hit to release an item",
  "^": "soft hazard: walkable floor that bumps Paddy and chips health, never kills",
  "~": "mud-flat shallows / river (soft): Paddy wades in, it is NOT standable; falling in = short soft respawn on the last bank. Never deadly.",
  "L": "ledge-grab edge: solid like #, plus Paddy can grab its top corner from below/side and pull up",
  "T": "climbable trunk / pole / pier: NOT solid; hold ↑ while overlapping to cling and climb, ←/→ steps onto an adjacent branch, beam, railing, ledge or roof, jump leaps off (deco: q post, d drainpipe, 3 concrete bridge pier)",
  "F": "fence top: 1-tile-thin walkable rail, one-way (land from above, jump up through, ↓ drops); posts/palings below are deco only",
  ".": "empty",
  "J": "bounce pad (in-ground mini trampoline): SOLID, flush with the ground, walk across it normally. Landing on it from a jump or fall launches Paddy straight up ~6 tiles (hold jump for full height, hold ↓ to absorb and stop); can double-jump after. No damage. Main path never needs a bounce; pads lead to sky coins, the gazebo roof and the swing."
 },
 "entityTypes": {
  "kid": "{type:'kid', kind:'scooter'|'skateboard', x, y, range, harmless:true, hitbox:false, bonus:'hop'}: ambient NPC kid that rides back and forth over x..x+range on feet row y. HARMLESS: never deals damage and never knocks Paddy back; hitbox:false = no collision at all (Paddy walks straight through) and it cannot be attacked (swipes pass through). bonus:'hop' = Paddy hopping over the kid (airborne directly above it) gives a small coin bonus (suggest +3 coins, once per pass). Not an obstacle; the validator ignores kids for pathing/lanes.",
  "car": "{type:\"car\", name, lane, x0, x1, speed, dir}: dodge-only moving hazard, ~2 tiles tall x 3 long. lane = feet row it drives on; it shuttles between x0 and x1 (tiles) at speed tiles/s starting in dir (+1 right / -1 left), turning at the ends. Touching it = a gentle bump (small hop away, brief invulnerability), NO damage, never kills. Cannot be attacked. Never leaves x0..x1: the tiles just outside are safe islands / kerbs. Paddy can single-jump over a car.",
  "bus": "{type:\"bus\", ...same fields}: like car but ~3 tiles tall x 5 long and slower; too tall to single-jump, so wait on the island or go over it on the traffic-light mast arm. Same bump, no damage.",
  "secret_paw": "{type:'secret_paw', id:'w1-<n>', x, y}: hidden golden-paw collectible (World 1 has 10: w1-1..w1-10, spread over silverdale_1..7). (x,y) = tile cell like other pickups (feet-cell convention); it floats there, no collision, collected on touch, never respawns once taken. id is unique across the game so the save file can track which paws are found; collecting all 10 is meant to unlock a reward (e.g. awakened character forms) - Game Studio to wire. Placed off the main path in hidden-but-fair cat-route spots.",
  "rooster": "{type:\"enemy\", id:\"rooster\"}: ground enemy (farmyard). Struts, then a short flapping hop-charge peck (1 heart); 3 hits. Like other ground enemies it needs a surface under its feet.",
  "crab": "{type:\"enemy\", id:\"crab\"}: ground enemy on mud flats. Scuttles sideways, pinch (1 heart); 2 hits; flips onto its back when swiped.",
  "eel": "{type:\"enemy\", id:\"eel\", water:true}: lives IN open shallow water: (x,y) is a \"~\" cell in a pool >=3 wide with open sky above. Lunges up out of the water when Paddy jumps over / wades nearby (1 heart), then sinks back; can be swiped while out. Never leaves the water.",
  "bossArena": "bossArena {name, boss, x0, x1, floorY, bossSpawn, bossSize, walls{left,right,rows,closeOnEnter,openOn,triggerX}, ledges, pillars, phase2{atHealth, adds[{id,x}]}}: walls are full-height gates that rise when Paddy passes triggerX and drop when the boss is K.O.; phase2 spawns the adds once boss health <= atHealth."
 },
