 "leadsTo": "World 2-1 Millwater (from the Silverdale St bridge top)",
 "notes": "Entity y = feet cell; ground top is row 10. Level part x0-182, boss arena x184-217 (34 wide), bridge-top goal x222. Mud-flat shallows (~) are soft: max 4 wide on the main path, falling in = soft respawn on the bank, never deadly. Eels live only in open pools (no platform above). Cat route: shop-backs roof, cabbage trees/kohekohe, mangrove roots, jetty posts, new-bridge railing and under-bridge beams. Boss arena: flat mud/concrete floor row 10, rows 0-9 fully open (bridge deck is background deco), two climbable pillars + one low ledge each near the walls (centre lane x190-211 clear), walls both ends close on entry. No Siamese; kids: none in this level."
